NAME: known bug: inner let shadows an outer store placement
DESCRIPTION: characterization of current output (i-7d2612-ce4c3b); ADD 4 x targets the B-field, see behtests/let_shadowing.beh
SRC:
(let (x 1)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 3))
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (let (x 2)
      (DAT 0 (store x)))
    (ADD 4 x) ))
